                <div class="flex">
                    <div class="col-half">
                        <h3>Problem</h3>
                        <p class="process-main-text"><b>Scaling Quality and Speed</b> In a complex enterprise environment, delivering consistent user experiences is a constant struggle. We faced two primary challenges:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><b>Inefficiency:</b> Designers and engineers were "reinventing the wheel" for every feature, leading to wasted effort and slow delivery.</li>
                            <li><b>Fragmentation:</b> A lack of standardized components resulted in a disjointed user experience and inconsistent accessibility compliance across the platform.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                <div class="col-half">
                    <h3>Outcome</h3>
                    <p class="process-main-text">I co-architected a modular, 508-compliant component library that <b>reduced "time to delivery" by more than 25%</b>, while ensuring that accessible patterns were "baked into" the code from day one.</p>
                </div>            
